{"id":"children_verses","sections":[{"title":{"he":"פסוקים לילדים","en":"Verses for Children"},"segments":[{"key":"0RNHBhZH-Y","he":[[{"t":"תּוֹרָה צִוָּה־לָנוּ מֹשֶׁה מוֹרָשָׁה קְהִלַּת יַעֲקֹב׃"}]],"en":"Moses commanded us a law, An inheritance of the congregation of Jacob."},{"key":"4yxCdPSy5E","he":[[{"t":"שְׁמַע יִשְׂרָאֵל יְהֹוָה אֱלֹהֵינוּ יְהֹוָה אֶחָד׃"}]],"en":"HEAR, O ISRAEL: THE LORD OUR GOD, THE LORD IS ONE."},{"key":"YIJA1Y-OIB","he":[[{"t":"הַמַּלְאָךְ הַגֹּאֵל אֹתִי מִכָּל־רָע יְבָרֵךְ אֶת־הַנְּעָרִים וְיִקָּרֵא בָהֶם שְׁמִי וְשֵׁם אֲבֹתַי אַבְרָהָם וְיִצְחָק וְיִדְגּוּ לָרֹב בְּקֶרֶב הָאָרֶץ׃"}]],"en":"the angel who hath redeemed me from all evil, bless the lads; and let my name be named in them, and the name of my fathers Abraham and Isaac; and let them grow into a multitude in the midst of the earth.’"}]}],"credits":[{"title":"Deuteronomy — Tanach with Nikkud","license":"Public Domain","url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Deuteronomy"},{"title":"Deuteronomy — The Holy Scriptures (JPS 1917)","license":"Public Domain","url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Deuteronomy"},{"title":"Genesis — Tanach with Nikkud","license":"Public Domain","url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Genesis"},{"title":"Genesis — The Holy Scriptures (JPS 1917)","license":"Public Domain","url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Genesis"}]}